<title>BRAZIL: Trade in Bamerindus to resume at 1630 GMT.</title>
<headline>Trade in Bamerindus to resume at 1630 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in Brazilian private bank Bamerindus will resume at 1430 local/1630 GMT on the local stock exchanges, the Sao Paulo bourse said.</p>
<p>Trade had been suspended earlier following press reports today saying investment banks Pactual and Icatu were the most likely candidates for handling finances of troubled bank Bamerindus and prepare it for sale to investors.</p>
</text>
